# Edge secrets (Dashboard or `supabase secrets set`):
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# Audio Sanctuary: upload HLS to private Storage bucket `meditations` (signed URLs via edge function)
#   MUX_TOKEN_ID, MUX_TOKEN_SECRET  (Mux → Settings → Access Tokens)
#   MUX_WEBHOOK_SECRET            (Mux → Settings → Webhooks → signing secret)
# Webhook endpoints:
#   https://qsplaoyrnsrdocllomkq.supabase.co/functions/v1/stripe-webhook
#   https://qsplaoyrnsrdocllomkq.supabase.co/functions/v1/mux-webhook
